{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gun Trader: The Town's Gunsmith</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're running a gun shop in a small town, dealing with dozens of customers every day. Stock the shelves, watch the prices, and buy low-sell high to turn a profit. But be careful \u2014 not every customer is innocent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Display your weapons, keep your customers happy, and enjoy the cash flow.<br>\ud83e\uddf9 Keep your shop clean \u2014 trash will scare customers away.<br>\ud83d\udcac Interact with the townspeople \u2014 weird and funny dialogues await.<br>\u26a0\ufe0f Threats and dangers can appear at any moment. Stay alert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may seem simple, but every detail matters.<br>It\u2019s your shop, your rules \u2014 but staying in business won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660150/extras/11cb778d2ea93438421eea4e879511ce.poster.avif?t=1752178410\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660150/extras/11cb778d2ea93438421eea4e879511ce.webm?t=1752178410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660150/extras/11cb778d2ea93438421eea4e879511ce.mp4?t=1752178410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>=========================================================================<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660150/extras/772d41718f9bf2d73a348b9f0c29db2d.poster.avif?t=1752178410\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660150/extras/772d41718f9bf2d73a348b9f0c29db2d.webm?t=1752178410\" type=\"video/w